-58 AC outperforms -43 AC by so much that twoweaponing (as powerful as it
is) really can't make up for it.  And that's exactly what the YANI would
provide for a Wizard, making him far and away the best late-game combat
character (provided he could get hold of any decent damage weapon -- 
either foobrand for example.)  So, I conclude it's not reasonable to
increase max possible AC by that much.

